<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] served as a guardian of forbidden tombs and bio-sealed reliquaries within the Crimson Arachna Cult. Whispered to the dead, catalogued relics, and performed maintenance on what should never be awoken. -->
  <OE_Cryptkeeper.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在深红蜘蛛教团中担任禁忌坟墓和生物封印圣物箱的守护者。对死者低语，编目圣物，并维护那些永远不应苏醒的东西。</OE_Cryptkeeper.description>
  <!-- EN: crimson arachna cryptkeeper -->
  <OE_Cryptkeeper.title>深红蜘蛛墓穴守护者</OE_Cryptkeeper.title>
  <!-- EN: cryptkeeper -->
  <OE_Cryptkeeper.titleShort>墓穴守护者</OE_Cryptkeeper.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] as a member of Crimson Arachna Cult has an unwavering faith and the desire to bring their faith to everyone in any way. -->
  <OE_Cultist.description>[PAWN_nameDef]作为深红蜘蛛教团的成员，拥有坚定不移的信仰，并渴望以任何方式将他们的信仰传播给每个人。</OE_Cultist.description>
  <!-- EN: crimson arachna cultist -->
  <OE_Cultist.title>深红蜘蛛教徒</OE_Cultist.title>
  <!-- EN: cultist -->
  <OE_Cultist.titleShort>教徒</OE_Cultist.titleShort>
  
</LanguageData>